124
00:06:12,090 --> 00:06:13,750
I really want one so I can watch TV.

125
00:06:14,210 --> 00:06:14,650
Recliner?

126
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:17,730
In my beautifully decorated living room?

127
00:06:17,730 --> 00:06:19,230
I don't think so.

128
